        "message": "docs(sandbox): reconciliation 22.9 corrected after the review of 19b8538\n\n- one stale test count (223 to 224) in the superseded-figures row;\n- the three residuals the review found and 22.9.4 lacked: hostile type names and\n  reprs escaping the hierarchy, the interrupt window in reserve(), the transient\n  over-count while a failing log call is unwound;\n- round 4 (b625392): the module's docstring and comments narrowed from \"any\n  exception\" to \"an Exception\", the owner assertion, and the figures re-measured\n  on b625392 (68 of 68 mutants, the reviewer's script 99 of 117, 14 of 14 ports,\n  224 guard tests, 308 in tests/core/sandbox, the CI-order group 339 passed);\n- file hashes updated to b625392; the ruff copy and version named.\nChanges only this document; nothing here is a ruling or a merge recommendation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzVx1NSzXF1YokR8a8PPiA",
